    "Your account, maps, chats and shared links will be permanently deleted. Your App Store subscription is not cancelled by this: cancel it first in the iPhone Settings → your name → Subscriptions. This can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account, maps, chats and shared links will be permanently deleted. Your App Store subscription is not cancelled by this: cancel it first in the iPhone Settings → your name → Subscriptions. This can’t be undone."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Аккаунт, карты, чаты и публичные ссылки будут удалены навсегда. Подписка в App Store при этом не отменяется: сначала отмените её в Настройках iPhone → ваше имя → Подписки. Это действие нельзя отменить."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your current plan"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ваш текущий тариф"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friends try Minor Plus for free, and you get days of Plus and a discount on a subscription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your friends try Minor Plus for free, and you get days of Plus and a discount on a subscription."
